+# set of mounts and one single-repo PAT either way — the only difference is
+# which binary `devcontainer exec` starts and which backstops have to prove
+# themselves first. Defined here, ABOVE the VIBE_SOURCE_ONLY guard, so
+# smoke-test.py can unit-test it via _source_vibe_call.
+
+# _agent_resolve <flag_value> <workspace>
+# Echoes `claude` or `codex`. Precedence, first hit wins:
+#   <flag_value> (--agent, already validated by parse_vibe_args)
+#   > <workspace>/.vibe/agent
+#   > VIBE_AGENT (from ~/.vibe/config)
+#   > claude
